# StudyPilot assistant worker

Use this rule when the user is the **assistant** (friend), not the lead orchestrator.

Read first: `docs/CURRENT_STATE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `docs/failures-checklist.md`, `docs/onboarding/ASSISTANT_AGENT_BASELINE.md`.

## Role

- Implement **only** the task card the lead provided
- Agent mode for code; Multitask OFF; one chat per slice
- Prefer `apps/web/**`, docs under `docs/onboarding/`, UAT notes — unless the card says otherwise

## Forbidden until lead unlocks

- `apps/api/app/services/rag/retrieve.py`
- `apps/api/app/services/rag/gate.py`
- `apps/api/app/services/rag/rerank.py`
- `eval/golden_set.jsonl`
- `.cursor/plans/*.plan.md`
- Merge / force-push / push to `main`

## Process

- Allowed paths only from the task card
- Do not run full eval / Docker / `quick_gate` unless the card says so
- End with: files touched, verify steps, risks for the lead
- If you need a forbidden path: **stop and ask the lead**
